#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_financial_resources
msgid ""
"For cash held in foreign currencies, amounts are converted into euros at the "
"exchange rate prevailing on the last business day before the fiscal year-"
"end. Any resulting exchange differences are recognized immediately in the "
"income statement as foreign exchange gains or losses."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບເງິນສົດທີ່ຖືເປັນສະກຸນເງິນຕາຕ່າງປະເທດ, ຈຳນວນເງິນຈະຖືກແປງເປັນເອີໂຣຕາມອັດຕາແລກປ່ຽນໃນມື້ເຮັດວຽກ"
"ສຸດທ້າຍກ່ອນສິ້ນສຸດສົກປີບັນຊີ. ຜົນຕ່າງອັດຕາແລກປ່ຽນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນທັງໝົດແມ່ນຮັບຮູ້ທັນທີໃນໃບລາຍງານຜົນການດຳເນີນງາ"
"ນ ເປັນກຳໄລ ຫຼື ຂາດທຶນຈາກອັດຕາແລກປ່ຽນ."

#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_transactions_with_management
