"ຖ້າມີ, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຜົນກະທົບຂອງລະບຽບການບັນຊີໃໝ່ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຕົ້ນງວດ, ລວມທັງລາຍການໃດແດ່ໃນບົດລາຍງາ"
"ນການເງິນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ."

#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_changes_in_accounting_policies
msgid ""
"If the change has been applied prospectively, explain the reasons for "
"prospective application and indicate the impact on key items for the period, "
"unless impracticable to determine."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແບບມີຜົນໃນອະນາຄົດ, ໃຫ້ອະທິບາຍເຫດຜົນຂອງການນຳໃຊ້ດັ່ງກ່າວ ແລະ ລະບຸຜົນກະທົບ"
"ຕໍ່ລາຍການຫຼັກໃນງວດ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ໃນພາກປະຕິບັດຕົວຈິງ."

#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_changes_in_accounting_policies
msgid ""
"If the change has been applied retrospectively, present the main items from "
"prior periods restated under the new accounting method."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແບບມີຜົນຍ້ອນຫຼັງ, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍການຫຼັກຈາກງວດກ່ອນໆທີ່ໄດ້ປັບປຸງໃໝ່ພາຍໃຕ້ວິທີການບັ"
"ນຊີໃໝ່."

#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_changes_in_accounting_policies
msgid ""
"If the change was applied <strong>prospectively</strong>, describe its "
"impact on the key items of the current period, unless such information is "
"impracticable to obtain."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ແບບມີຜົນໃນອະນາຄົດ</strong>, ໃຫ້ອະທິບາຍຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລາຍການຫຼັກຂອງ"
"ງວດປັດຈຸບັນ, ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງກ່າວບໍ່ສາມາດຫາໄດ້ໃນພາກປະຕິບັດຕົວຈິງ."

#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_changes_in_accounting_policies
msgid ""
"If the change was applied <strong>retrospectively</strong>, present the key "
"items from prior periods that have been restated in accordance with the new "
"method."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ແບບມີຜົນຍ້ອນຫຼັງ</strong>, ໃຫ້ສະແດງລາຍການຫຼັກຈາກງວດກ່ອນໆທີ່ໄດ້ຮັ"
"ບການປັບປຸງໃໝ່ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບວິທີການໃໝ່."

#. module: accountant_knowledge
#: model_terms:knowledge.article,template_body:accountant_knowledge.accountant_knowledge_article_template_asset_information
msgid ""
